@startuml
title 2번 슬라이드. 라우팅 규칙은 기본 규칙 + 예외 규칙으로 결정된다

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #CBD5E1
  FontColor #0F172A
  RoundCorner 18
}

skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #F0FDF4
  BorderColor #86EFAC
  FontColor #166534
}

left to right direction

rectangle "UseWriteDataSourceAspect\n@UseWriteDataSource가 붙으면\nWRITE 강제" as Aspect #FDE68A

rectangle "DataSourceRoutingContext\n강제 경로 저장" as Context #FEF3C7

rectangle "TransactionRoutingDataSource\n최종 라우팅 결정" as Routing #DBEAFE

rectangle "@Transactional(readOnly = true)\n기본 READ 힌트" as Tx #DCFCE7

rectangle "READ" as Read #DCFCE7
rectangle "WRITE" as Write #FDE68A

Aspect --> Context
Context --> Routing
Tx --> Routing
Routing --> Read
Routing --> Write

note bottom of Routing
결정 순서
1. 강제 경로가 있으면 우선 사용
2. 없으면 readOnly면 READ
3. 나머지는 WRITE
end note

note bottom of Aspect
즉, @UseWriteDataSource는
readOnly보다 더 높은 우선순위로
WRITE를 강제하는 예외 규칙이다.
end note

@enduml
